# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# Ignore ALL tfvars, including *.auto.tfvars. The previous `!*.auto.tfvars` un-ignore was
# a footgun: a `secret.auto.tfvars` would be committed. Secret values are passed via
# TF_VAR_* env or out-of-band, never a committed file.
*.tfvars
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Build artifacts
*.zip
# Lambda create-time seed zips are deliberately committed
!projects/*/lambda_seed.zip
*.tfplan
